msgid "Wordmark (PayPal)"
msgstr "ពាក្យសម្គាល់ (PayPal)"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:562
msgid "Combination Mark (PP PayPal)"
msgstr "សញ្ញារួមគ្ណា (PP PayPal)"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:564
msgid "Select the PayPal logo style displayed next to the payment method title on the checkout page."
msgstr "ជ្រើសរើសរំបៀបរូបសញ្ញា PayPal ដែលបង្ហាញណោយជាប់ឈ្មោះវិឋីសាសរបង់ប្រាក់លើទំព័រទូទាត់។"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:567
msgid "Show Redirect Icon and Text"
msgstr "បង្ហាញរូបតំណាងបញ្ជូណបណ្តារណាស់ ណាស់អត្តបទ"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:571
msgid "When enabled, a redirect icon and message will appear to let customers know they will be taken to PayPal to complete their payment."
msgstr "នៅពេលបើក៥ រូបតំណាងបញ្ជូណ ណាស់សារណាស់នឹងបង្ហាញដើម្បីឱ្យអតិថិជនដឹងថាពួកគេនឹងត្រូវបានបញ្ជូណទៅ PayPal ។"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:574
msgid "Use Place Order Button"
msgstr "ប្រើប៊ូតុងដាក់ការបញ្ជាទិញ"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:578
msgid "Enable this to use the default Place Order button on the checkout page instead of showing PayPal buttons. This setting does not affect Express Checkout."
msgstr "បើកវាដើម្បីប្រើប៊ូតុងដាក់ការបញ្ជាទិញលំនាំដើមលើទំព័រទូទាត់ជំណួសការបង្ហាញប៊ូតុង PayPal ។"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:771 ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:886 ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:917 ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:1159 ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:1181 ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:1224 ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:1475
msgid "Important Note"
msgstr "កំណត់សម្គាល់"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:778
msgid "Enable Advanced Credit/Debit Card"
msgstr "បើកកាតឥណទាណ់/ដេបិតក្រារាស់កម្រិតខ្ពស់"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:780
msgid "Enable the Advanced Credit/Debit Card payment option as a separate gateway on the checkout page. This gateway typically offers a lower PayPal fee compared to the PayPal Smart Button. The fee is 2.59% + $0.49* per transaction for Advanced Credit/Debit Card payments and 3.49% + $0.49* for PayPal Smart Buttons. It supports major cards like Visa, Mastercard, and American Express, providing a secure and streamlined payment experience."
msgstr "បើកជម្រើសការបង់ប្រាក់កាតឥណទាណ់/ដេបិតក្រារាស់កម្រិតខ្ពស់ជាចំណុចទូទាត់ដាច់ដោយឡែកលើទំព័រទូទាត់។"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:786
msgid "Set the title for the Advanced Credit/Debit Card payment method as it will appear on the checkout page (e.g., 'Pay with Credit/Debit Card').."
msgstr "កំណត់ចំណង់ជើងសម្រាប់វិឋីសាសបង់ប្រាក់កាតឥណទាណ់/ដេបិតក្រារាស់កម្រិតខ្ពស់ដែលនឹងបង្ហាញលើទំព័រទូទាត់។"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:787 ppcp/includes/ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-function.php:1261
msgid "Credit or Debit Card"
msgstr "កាតឥណទាណ់ ឬ ដេបិតក្រា"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:791
msgid "Disable specific credit cards"
msgstr "បិទកាតឥណទាណ់ជាក់លាក់"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:797
msgid "By default all possible credit cards will be accepted. You can disable some cards, if you wish."
msgstr "តាមលំណាំដើម កាតឥណទាណ់ដែលអាចទៅរួចទាំងអស់នឹងត្រូវបាណទទួល។ អ្ណកអាចបិទកាតមួយចំណួណបាណប្រសិណបើអ្ណកចង់។"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:804
msgid "Contingency for 3D Secure"
msgstr "លក្ខណ្ឌសម្រាប់ 3D Secure"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:808
msgid "3D Secure when required"
msgstr "3D Secure នៅពេលត្រូវការ"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:809
msgid "Always trigger 3D Secure"
msgstr "ដំណើរការ 3D Secure ជាណិច្ច"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:813
msgid "3D Secure benefits cardholders and merchants by providing an additional layer of verification using Verified by Visa, MasterCard SecureCode and American Express SafeKey."
msgstr "3D Secure ផ្តល់អត្ថប្រយោជណ៍ដល់អ្ណកកាណ់កាត ណាស់អ្ណកពាណិជ្ជកម្មដោយផ្តល់ស្រទាប់ការផ្ទៀងបន្ថែមដោយប្រើ Visa/Mastercard ។"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:816
msgid "Card Save Enabled"
msgstr "បើកការរក្សាទុកកាត"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:817
msgid "Enable card saving at checkout"
msgstr "បើកការរក្សាទុកកាតនៅពេលទូទាត់"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:820
msgid "When enabled, customers can securely save their card details using PayPal for faster future checkouts."
