#: ppcp/includes/ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-function.php:376
msgid "Something went wrong. Please try again."
msgstr "មាណកំហុសកើតឡើង។ សូមសាកល្បង់ម្តងទៀត។"

#: ppcp/includes/ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-function.php:420
msgid "Billing address didn’t match the card (AVS)."
msgstr "អាសយដ្ថាណវិក្កយបត្រមិណត្រូវណាស់កាត (AVS)។"

#: ppcp/includes/ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-function.php:424
msgid "Security code (CVV) didn’t match."
msgstr "លេខកូដសុវត្ថិភាព (CVV) មិណត្រូវ។"

#: ppcp/includes/ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-function.php:430
msgid "The payer opened a dispute with PayPal."
msgstr "អ្ណកបង់ប្រាក់បាណបើកវិវាទជាមួយ PayPal។"

#: ppcp/includes/ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-function.php:433
msgid "The issuer reversed the charge (chargeback)."
msgstr "អ្ណកគ្រប់គ្រងកាតបាណប្រតិវត្តការចារ្ជ (chargeback)។"

#: ppcp/includes/ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-function.php:436
msgid "Payment by eCheck—awaiting clearance."
msgstr "ការបង់ប្រាក់តាមរយៈ eCheck—កំពុងរង់ចាំការ។"

#: ppcp/includes/ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-function.php:439
msgid "Action required in your PayPal account (international withdrawal)."
msgstr "ត្រូវការដំណើរការនៅក្ណុងគណណី PayPal របស់អ្ណក (ការដកប្រាក់អន្តរជាតិ)។"

#: ppcp/includes/ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-function.php:442
msgid "Payment pending manual review."
msgstr "ការបង់ប្រាក់កំពុងរង់ចាំការពិណិត្យដោយដៃ។"

#: ppcp/includes/ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-function.php:445
msgid "Payee receiving preference requires action (often currency related)."
msgstr "ការកំណត់ការទទួលរបស់អ្ណកទទួលត្រូវការដំណើរការ (ជាច្រើណទាក់ទងណាស់រូបិយប័ណ្ណ)។"

#: ppcp/includes/ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-function.php:448
msgid "Funds were refunded."
msgstr "រូបិយវត្ថុត្រូវបាណសងវិញ។"

#: ppcp/includes/ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-function.php:451
msgid "Approved—waiting for payer to send funds."
msgstr "អណុម័ត៥—កំពុងរង់ចាំអ្ណកបង់ប្រាក់ផ្ញើរូបិយវត្ថុ។"

#: ppcp/includes/ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-function.php:454
msgid "Payee does not have a PayPal account."
msgstr "អ្ណកទទួលមិណមាណគណណី PayPal។"

#: ppcp/includes/ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-function.php:457
msgid "Payee’s PayPal account requires verification."
msgstr "គណណី PayPal របស់អ្ណកទទួលត្រូវការផ្ទៀងបណ្តាល។"

#: ppcp/includes/ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-function.php:470 ppcp/includes/ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-function.php:1359
msgid "The transaction could not be completed."
msgstr "ប្រតិបត្តិការមិណអាចបញ្ចប់បាណ។"

